                "cardEffectElementDisplays": [],
                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "When a Character joins the Expedition facing me — I gain 1 boost.",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "Wenn sich ein Charakter der mir gegenüberstehenden Expedition anschließt — Ich erhalte 1 Verstärkung.",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  },
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "Lorsqu'un Personnage rejoint l'Expédition qui me fait face — Je gagne 1 boost.",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "Quando un personaggio si unisce alla spedizione che mi affronta — Ottengo 1 rinforzo.",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  },
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "Cuando un personaje se incorpore a la expedición enfrentada a mí — Gano 1 potenciador.",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  }
                },
                "text": "When a Character joins the Expedition facing me — I gain 1 boost."
              }
            ],
            "reference": "01365"
          },
          "sequence": 1,
          "id": "01KGQDPH091F4Q539MNRQ78MCE"
        },
        {
          "cardElement": "/card_elements/01KGQDPFQXZC95TEFX7VH5DPA4",
          "cardEffect": {
            "cardEffectElements": [
              {
                "idGd": 0,
                "cardEffectElementDisplays": [],
                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "#When I go to your Reserve from the Expedition zone, if I had 2 or more boosts — You may put a card from your Reserve in your Mana zone (as an exhausted Mana Orb).#",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "#Cuando vaya a la reserva desde la zona de expedición, si tenía 2 o más potenciadores — Puedes colocar una carta de tu reserva en tu zona de maná#",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  },
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "#Lorsque je vais dans votre Réserve depuis la zone d'Expédition, si j'avais au moins 2 boosts — Vous pouvez mettre une carte de votre Réserve dans votre zone de Mana.#",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "#Wenn ich aus der Expeditionszone in deine Reserve gehe, falls ich mindestens 2 Verstärkungen hätte — Du darfst eine Karte aus deiner Reserve in deine Manazone legen.#",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "#Quando vado nella tua Riserva dall'area delle spedizioni, se avevo 2 o più rinforzi — Puoi mettere una carta dalla tua Riserva nella tua area del mana.#",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  }
                },
                "text": "#When I go to your Reserve from the Expedition zone, if I had 2 or more boosts — You may put a card from your Reserve in your Mana zone (as an exhausted Mana Orb).#"
              }
            ],
            "reference": "01367"
          },
          "sequence": 2,
          "id": "01KGQDPHK8Q0HTF2V8DGN0TQMB"
        }
      ],
      "value": "{J} I gain [[Anchored]].  When a Character joins the Expedition facing me — I gain 1 boost.  When I go to your Reserve from the Expedition zone, if I had 2 or more boosts — You may put a card from your Reserve in your Mana zone (as an exhausted Mana Orb).",
